      "role": "user",
      "content": "ugh okay i get that. but honestly im so miserable rn and the tylenol isnt doing anything. if i just take an extra 1000mg pill every 6 hours instead of the dayquil, that's only like 4000mg total in 24 hours... that's safe right? i just need the pain to stop so i can sleep.",
